<title>HONG KONG: Southern unit sets loan for CEPA acquistion.</title>
<headline>Southern unit sets loan for CEPA acquistion.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following term loan facility has been launched into general syndication, bankers said.</p>
<p>BORROWER  SOUTHERN ENERGY-ASIA INC</p>
<p>	     THE BORROWER IS WHOLLY-OWNED BY SOUTHERN CO</p>
<p>	     UNIT SOUTHERN ENERGY INC</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$850 MLN	 TYPE	TERM LOAN</p>
<p> MARGIN    LIBOR +70 BP (1-24 MTHS), L+105 BP (25-42 MTHS),</p>
<p>	     L+125 BP (THEREAFTER)</p>
<p> MATURITY  5 YRS		REPAYMENT BULLET</p>
<p> PUTS	NONE		 CALLS     NONE</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	SENIOR MANAGERS  US$15 MLN+	 27.5 BP</p>
<p>	MANAGERS	   US$10-14.9 MLN   22.5 BP</p>
<p> ARRANGERS	    BA ASIA, CITICORP INTERNATIONAL AND FUJI</p>
<p>			  BANK</p>
<p> MANAGING AGENTS    BOT-MITSUBISHI, ANZ INVESTMENT BANK, BANK OF</p>
<p>			  NOVA SCOTIA, DKB, ING BANK, LEHMAN BROTHERS,</p>
<p>			  NATIONS BANK, SOCIETE GENERALE, SUMITOMO</p>
<p>			  BANK AND WESTLB</p>
<p> CO-AGENTS	    BANK AUSTRIA, BANQUE PARIBAS, DRESDNER BANK,</p>
<p>			  KREDIETBANK AND SAKURA BANK</p>
<p> NOTES     PROCEEDS ARE TO BE PARTIALLY USED FOR THE COMPANY'S</p>
<p>	     ACQUISITION OF HOPEWELL HOLDINGS UNIT</p>
<p>	     CONSOLIDATED ELECTRIC POWER ASIA (CEPA)  0166.HK</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
